{"2272720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EXODIUM Part 1", "steam_appid": 2272720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The late 21st century. Humanity has learned to preserve human personalities in digital form, while electronic implants have become part of the living brain. Environmental disasters, wars, and epidemics have changed the world. Many cities have disappeared, and scientific facilities, military bases, and research stations have become the new centers of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272720/extras/800d0714255598df0e17846fd82f242c.avif?t=1787831956\" width=560 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death no longer necessarily means the end of existence. Human personalities can continue to live in machines, while artificial intelligence can develop a will of its own. Genetic experiments have created new forms of life, and technology makes it possible to accomplish the impossible and change the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272720/extras/4d7763b692d82ff5b8fab5bc6add7ec8.avif?t=1787831956\" width=560 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Locations and Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military facilities, secret laboratories, underground complexes, and space stations. Scientists, military personnel, androids, robots, artificial intelligences, and genetic prototypes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272720/extras/53e57a9b3c5f1080987b4c1796afb29c.avif?t=1787831956\" width=556 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as multiple characters, using their unique skills, weapons, abilities, and ways of interacting with the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate reactors, quantum transmitters, and other complex equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with humans, androids, and artificial intelligence that goes beyond its original directives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore scientific and military facilities, restore equipment, and uncover the history of this world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272720/extras/7e66f72257d80b84a6b08b0fb5dde2a0.avif?t=1787831956\" width=700 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The late 21st century. Humanity has learned to preserve human personalities in digital form, while electronic implants have become part of the living brain. Environmental disasters, wars, and epidemics have changed the world. Many cities have disappeared, and scientific facilities, military bases, and research stations have become the new centers of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272720/extras/800d0714255598df0e17846fd82f242c.avif?t=1787831956\" width=560 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death no longer necessarily means the end of existence. Human personalities can continue to live in machines, while artificial i